@startuml 01_level1
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FEF3C7

title PPMP Management System - Level 1 DFD
rectangle "All authenticated roles / login user" as U
rectangle "System Administrator" as A
rectangle "Department Preparer" as E
rectangle "Department Head" as H
rectangle "Budget Reviewer" as B
rectangle "Procurement Reviewer" as R
rectangle "Authorized Approver" as F
rectangle "Auditor / Viewer" as V
usecase "1.0\nAuthenticate and Manage Access" as P1
usecase "2.0\nMaintain Planning Reference Data" as P2
usecase "3.0\nPrepare and Submit Department PPMP" as P3
usecase "4.0\nReview and Decide on Submitted Versions" as P4
usecase "5.0\nConsolidate and Produce Reports" as P5
usecase "6.0\nRecord Audit Events and Notifications" as P6
database "D1 Identity and Access\nusers, departments, memberships, roles,\npermissions, role assignments, sessions" as D1
database "D2 Planning Reference Data\nfiscal years, planning groups, owner mappings,\nitems, units, expense objects, annual prices,\nfunds, methods, allocations, workflow templates" as D2
database "D3 PPMP Plans and Versions\nplan identities, version headers,\nversion items, quarterly quantities, snapshots" as D3
database "D4 Private Attachments\nversion-linked metadata and file objects" as D4
database "D5 Review Records\nreview instances, assigned stages,\nappend-only decisions and comments" as D5
database "D6 Consolidations and Exports\nreport runs, selected versions, source-line links,\nexport metadata and private output files" as D6
database "D7 Append-only Audit Log" as D7
database "D8 Event Outbox and Notifications" as D8

U --> P1 : F001 Login / logout / session request\n[AUTH]
P1 --> U : F002 Authentication result\n[AUTH_RESULT]
A --> P1 : F003 Account and department access changes\n[ACCOUNT_CHANGE]
P1 --> A : F004 Account administration result\n[ACCESS_RESULT]
D1 --> P1 : F005 Identity, access and session records\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
P1 --> D1 : F006 Validated accounts, access and sessions\n[ACCESS_WRITE]
A --> P2 : F007 Catalog, planning and workflow changes\n[SETUP_CHANGE]
P2 --> A : F008 Reference-data result\n[SETUP_RESULT]
D1 --> P2 : F009 Administrator permission scope\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
D2 --> P2 : F010 Existing reference records\n[REFERENCE]
P2 --> D2 : F011 Validated reference records\n[REFERENCE_WRITE]
E --> P3 : F012 Draft, revision and submission request\n[DRAFT_REQUEST]
E --> P3 : F013 Attachment upload / retrieval / unlink\n[FILE_REQUEST]
P3 --> E : F014 Draft detail, totals and validation result\n[DRAFT_RESULT]
D1 --> P3 : F015 User and department permissions\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
D2 --> P3 : F016 Owned groups, catalog, prices and rules\n[REFERENCE]
D3 --> P3 : F017 Existing plan and version content\n[PLAN_READ]
P3 --> D3 : F018 Draft content or immutable submitted version\n[DRAFT_WRITE]
D4 --> P3 : F019 Version attachment records and bytes\n[ATTACH_READ]
P3 --> D4 : F020 Validated draft attachments\n[ATTACH_WRITE]
D5 --> P3 : F021 Return comments and review status\n[REVIEW_READ]
P3 --> P4 : F022 Submitted version reference\n[SUBMISSION]
H --> P4 : F023 Review queue / version / attachment request\n[REVIEW_QUERY]
H --> P4 : F024 Endorsement or return with comments\n[HEAD_DECISION]
P4 --> H : F025 Head review packet and action result\n[REVIEW_PACKET]
B --> P4 : F026 Review queue / version / attachment request\n[REVIEW_QUERY]
B --> P4 : F027 Budget findings and decision\n[BUDGET_DECISION]
P4 --> B : F028 Budget review packet and action result\n[REVIEW_PACKET]
R --> P4 : F029 Review queue / version / attachment request\n[REVIEW_QUERY]
R --> P4 : F030 Procurement findings and decision\n[PROC_DECISION]
P4 --> R : F031 Procurement review packet and action result\n[REVIEW_PACKET]
F --> P4 : F032 Review queue / version / attachment request\n[REVIEW_QUERY]
F --> P4 : F033 Approval, return or rejection\n[FINAL_DECISION]
P4 --> F : F034 Approval packet and action result\n[REVIEW_PACKET]
D1 --> P4 : F035 Current reviewer authority and scope\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
D2 --> P4 : F036 Workflow templates and budget context\n[REFERENCE]
D3 --> P4 : F037 Submitted content and effective version\n[PLAN_READ]
D4 --> P4 : F038 Submitted attachment records and bytes\n[ATTACH_READ]
D5 --> P4 : F039 Existing stages, comments and decisions\n[REVIEW_READ]
P4 --> D5 : F040 Review assignments, decisions and comments\n[REVIEW_WRITE]
P4 --> D3 : F041 Version state and effective approved version\n[PLAN_STATE_WRITE]
U --> P5 : F042 Scoped dashboard / report / export request\n[REPORT_QUERY]
R --> P5 : F043 Approved-version consolidation request\n[CONSOLIDATE_REQUEST]
P5 --> U : F044 Scoped report, totals or export result\n[REPORT_RESULT]
D1 --> P5 : F045 Report permissions and department scope\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
D2 --> P5 : F046 Group mappings and report reference data\n[REFERENCE]
D3 --> P5 : F047 Selected versions and quarterly item data\n[PLAN_READ]
D5 --> P5 : F048 Approval evidence and status history\n[REVIEW_READ]
D6 --> P5 : F049 Existing report lineage and output files\n[REPORT_READ]
P5 --> D6 : F050 Report snapshot, lineage and export files\n[REPORT_WRITE]
U --> P6 : F051 Notification query / read acknowledgement\n[INBOX_QUERY]
P6 --> U : F052 Recipient notifications and unread count\n[INBOX_RESULT]
V --> P6 : F053 Authorized audit-history query\n[AUDIT_QUERY]
P6 --> V : F054 Filtered audit history\n[AUDIT_RESULT]
D1 --> P6 : F055 Recipient membership and audit permissions\n[ACCESS_RECORDS]
D7 --> P6 : F056 Scoped audit entries\n[AUDIT_READ]
P6 --> D7 : F057 Redacted append-only audit entries\n[AUDIT_WRITE]
D8 --> P6 : F058 Committed events and recipient inbox records\n[OUTBOX_READ]
P6 --> D8 : F059 Committed events, inbox messages and read state\n[OUTBOX_WRITE]
P1 --> P6 : F060 Process 1.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P2 --> P6 : F061 Process 2.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P3 --> P6 : F062 Process 3.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P4 --> P6 : F063 Process 4.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
P5 --> P6 : F064 Process 5.0 audit / notification event\n[DOMAIN_EVENT]
legend bottom
Rectangle = external role; oval = data-transforming process
Cylinder = logical data store; arrow = named data payload
U groups all roles for shared login, reports and inbox functions.
Numbered process peers in Level 2 are outside the decomposed process.
Packet fields: FLOW_REGISTER.md; relationships: DATA_DICTIONARY.md
endlegend
note as DesignNote
Proposed internal approval workflow; exact stage order requires agency confirmation.
Only approved versions feed official consolidation. Draft dashboards are labelled separately.
end note
@enduml
